config IO_URING
	bool "Enable io_uring uring support"
	depends on BLOCK
	help
	  This option enables support for io_uring, a Linux-native
	  io_uring interface.

	  Improved throughput and efficiency for storage and networking,
	  without the complexity and overhead of existing "aio" interface.
